---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { catalog, getAsset } from '../../../lib/catalog';
import { globalSystems } from '../../../lib/global-systems';
import { activeReleaseContext } from '../../../lib/release-context';
import { siteHref } from '../../../lib/site-context';
import '../../../styles/gacha-history.css';

const data = JSON.stringify({
  pools: globalSystems.gachaPools.map(p => ({ id: p.id, name: p.name, prizeGroupIds: p.prizeGroupIds, products: p.products })),
  prizes: globalSystems.gachaHistoryPrizes ?? [],
  cards: [...catalog.memberCards.map(c => ({ ...c, resourceType: 2 })), ...catalog.supportCards.map(c => ({ ...c, resourceType: 3 }))].map(c => {
    const asset = getAsset(c.thumbnailAssetId ?? c.primaryAssetId), image = asset?.thumbnailUrl ?? asset?.previewUrl;
    const artwork = getAsset(c.primaryAssetId)?.previewUrl ?? image;
    return {
      resourceType: c.resourceType,
      masterId: c.masterId,
      name: c.displayName,
      rarity: c.rarity,
      image: image ? siteHref(image, activeReleaseContext) : null,
      artwork: artwork ? siteHref(artwork, activeReleaseContext) : null,
      href: siteHref(`/cards/${c.resourceType === 2 ? 'members' : 'supports'}/${c.id}/`, activeReleaseContext),
    };
  }),
}).replaceAll('<', '\\u003c');
---
<BaseLayout title="抽卡记录">
  <div class="gacha-page">
    <gacha-history-tool class="gacha-tool">
      <script is:inline type="application/json" data-gacha-catalog set:html={data}></script>

      <header class="gacha-topbar gacha-panel">
        <div class="gacha-topbar-status">
          <span class="gacha-status-badge" data-gacha-mode-badge>未读取</span>
          <p data-gacha-status class="gacha-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">通过全站账号同步读取本次抽卡记录，或先浏览示例报告。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gacha-topbar-actions">
          <button type="button" class="gacha-primary" data-gacha-open-hub>登录并同步抽卡记录</button>
          <button type="button" class="gacha-secondary-btn" data-gacha-demo>预览示例报告</button>
          <button type="button" class="gacha-clear" data-gacha-clear hidden>清空当前记录</button>
          <details class="ui-tip-disclosure ui-tip-disclosure--icon-only" data-tip-align="right">
            <summary aria-label="统计范围与隐私说明" title="统计范围与隐私说明">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2" /><path d="M8 7.2v4M8 4.8v.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="ui-tip-body">
              <p>支持港澳台、EN、韩服 BHK 邮箱账号（请先确认顶部区服）；每次查询重新登录，仅保留当前页面会话结果，刷新或离开后清空。</p>
              <p data-gacha-statistics-note></p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </header>


      <section class="gacha-welcome gacha-panel" data-gacha-empty>
        <div class="gacha-empty-cards" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="gacha-card-fan gacha-card-fan--left"><b>SSR</b><small>Member</small></span>
          <span class="gacha-card-fan gacha-card-fan--center"><b>UP</b><small>Pick-up</small></span>
          <span class="gacha-card-fan gacha-card-fan--right"><b>BD</b><small>Special</small></span>
        </div>
        <h2>看看这次抽出了哪些高光瞬间</h2>
        <p>统一登录一键读取官方抽卡历史，自动汇总当期 UP、角色卡与留影分布，生成高光陈列墙与专属成绩单分享图。</p>
        <div class="gacha-welcome-actions">
          <button type="button" class="gacha-primary" data-gacha-open-hub>登录 BHK 账号同步</button>
          <button type="button" class="gacha-secondary-btn" data-gacha-demo>先看看示例报告</button>
        </div>
        <ul class="gacha-feature-pills">
          <li>按卡池点击直筛</li>
          <li>高光卡面陈列墙</li>
          <li>本地绘制分享长图</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div data-gacha-result hidden>
        <section class="gacha-filters gacha-panel" aria-label="统计范围">
          <label class="gacha-pool-select">查看卡池<select data-gacha-pool><option value="all">全部卡池</option></select></label>
          <label>开始日期<input type="date" data-gacha-from /></label>
          <label>结束日期<input type="date" data-gacha-to /></label>
          <button type="button" class="gacha-primary" data-gacha-share disabled>生成分享成绩单</button>
          <p data-gacha-filter-status role="status"></p>
        </section>

        <section class="gacha-hero-report" aria-label="抽卡战绩总览">
          <article class="gacha-persona gacha-panel" data-gacha-persona data-tier="steady">
            <div class="gacha-persona-ring-wrap">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 96 96" class="gacha-persona-svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle class="gacha-ring-track" cx="48" cy="48" r="38" />
                <circle class="gacha-ring-progress" data-gacha-ring cx="48" cy="48" r="38" />
              </svg>
              <div class="gacha-persona-rate">
                <strong data-gacha-rate>—</strong>
                <span>高稀有占比</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gacha-persona-copy">
              <div class="gacha-persona-title-row">
                <span class="gacha-persona-badge" data-gacha-persona-badge>统计中</span>
                <details class="ui-tip-disclosure ui-tip-disclosure--icon-only" data-tip-align="left">
                  <summary aria-label="称号判定与数据边界说明">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                      <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2" /><path d="M8 7.2v4M8 4.8v.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    </svg>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="ui-tip-body">
                    <p>趣味称号仅基于当前范围内已确认的高稀有度比例（≥10% 欧皇附体、≥5% 小欧怡情、≥2% 平稳发挥、&lt;2% 非酋渡劫；不足 20 抽不评级），不代表官方概率或下次预测。</p>
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div>
              <h2 data-gacha-persona-title>这次的抽卡战绩</h2>
              <p class="gacha-persona-note" data-gacha-persona-note></p>
              <p class="gacha-range" data-gacha-range></p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <dl class="gacha-metrics">
            <div><dt>本次抽数</dt><dd data-gacha-total>—</dd><small data-gacha-total-detail></small></div>
            <div><dt>SSR 角色卡</dt><dd data-gacha-member-ssr>—</dd><small data-gacha-member-detail></small></div>
            <div><dt>SSR 留影</dt><dd data-gacha-support-ssr>—</dd><small data-gacha-support-detail></small></div>
            <div><dt>当期 UP</dt><dd data-gacha-pickup>—</dd><small data-gacha-pickup-detail></small></div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <p data-gacha-share-status role="status" class="gacha-share-feedback"></p>

        <section class="gacha-album gacha-panel" aria-labelledby="gacha-album-title">
          <div class="gacha-section-heading">
            <div>
              <h2 id="gacha-album-title">高光出货陈列墙</h2>
              <p class="gacha-muted" data-gacha-album-count></p>
            </div>
            <div class="gacha-album-controls">
              <div class="gacha-segmented" role="group" aria-label="相册卡牌种类">
                <button type="button" data-gacha-album-kind="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button>
                <button type="button" data-gacha-album-kind="member" aria-pressed="false">角色卡</button>
                <button type="button" data-gacha-album-kind="support" aria-pressed="false">留影</button>
              </div>
              <label class="gacha-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-gacha-album-up />只看当期 UP</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gacha-album-grid" data-gacha-album></div>
          <button type="button" class="gacha-more" data-gacha-album-more hidden>显示更多卡牌</button>
          <p class="gacha-chart-note">同一卡牌合并张数展示；金色角标标识当期 UP 数量，下方切换筛选不影响总数统计与分享图。</p>
        </section>

        <section class="gacha-distribution-section" aria-labelledby="gacha-distribution-title">
          <div class="gacha-section-heading">
            <h2 id="gacha-distribution-title">稀有度分布</h2>
            <span class="gacha-chart-legend"><i class="gacha-key-up"></i>当期 UP <i class="gacha-key-unknown"></i>UP 未判定</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gacha-distribution" data-gacha-distribution></div>
        </section>

        <p class="gacha-coverage" data-gacha-coverage></p>

        <div class="gacha-secondary-charts">
          <section class="gacha-panel">
            <div class="gacha-section-heading">
              <h2>各池抽数</h2>
              <span class="gacha-muted">点击卡池条可联动筛选</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gacha-pool-bars" data-gacha-pools></div>
          </section>
          <section class="gacha-panel">
            <div class="gacha-section-heading">
              <h2>抽卡日期走势</h2>
              <span class="gacha-chart-legend"><i class="gacha-key-member"></i>角色卡 <i class="gacha-key-support"></i>留影 <i class="gacha-key-star">✦</i>含高稀有</span>
            </div>
            <div data-gacha-trend></div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <section class="gacha-panel gacha-records" aria-labelledby="gacha-records-title">
          <header>
            <div>
              <h2 id="gacha-records-title">抽卡明细</h2>
              <p data-gacha-record-count class="gacha-muted"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="gacha-record-filters">
              <label>卡牌种类<select data-gacha-kind><option value="all">全部种类</option><option value="member">角色卡</option><option value="support">留影</option><option value="item">道具</option><option value="unknown">未识别</option></select></label>
              <label>稀有度<select data-gacha-rarity><option value="all">全部稀有度</option><option value="4">SSR</option><option value="10">EX</option><option value="20">BD</option><option value="3">SR</option><option value="2">R</option></select></label>
              <label>UP 状态<select data-gacha-up><option value="all">全部状态</option><option value="yes">当期 UP</option><option value="no">非 UP</option><option value="unknown">未判定</option></select></label>
            </div>
          </header>
          <p class="gacha-chart-note">同批次十连／单抽奖品不区分先后顺序，不计算保底计数。</p>
          <ol class="gacha-record-list" data-gacha-record-list></ol>
          <nav class="gacha-pagination" aria-label="记录分页">
            <button type="button" data-gacha-previous>上一页</button>
            <span data-gacha-page>1 / 1</span>
            <button type="button" data-gacha-next>下一页</button>
          </nav>
        </section>
      </div>

      <dialog class="gacha-share-dialog" data-gacha-share-dialog aria-labelledby="gacha-share-title">
        <header>
          <div>
            <h2 id="gacha-share-title">抽卡记录分享图</h2>
            <p>包含所选卡池与日期范围，每类最多展示 6 种高光卡牌。</p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="ui-icon-btn" data-gacha-share-close aria-label="关闭分享图片" title="关闭">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" /></svg>
          </button>
        </header>
        <img data-gacha-share-image alt="抽卡记录：角色卡和留影统计、SSR 与 UP 卡图" />
        <footer>
          <a class="gacha-primary" data-gacha-download download="otonote-gacha-report.png">下载 PNG 图片</a>
          <small>也可长按或右键图片保存</small>
        </footer>
      </dialog>
    </gacha-history-tool>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import '../../../lib/gacha-history-ui.mjs';</script>
